      "message": "Why does WifiConnectivityManager need to know whether ExternalScoreEvaluator or RecommendedNetworkEvaluator should be employed?  Shouldn\u0027t this be an implementation detail of ExternalScoreEvaluator, or perhaps an factory object?",
